Modified for Sklubot (2026-11-22): the four React/StyleX page templates rewritten as four standalone HTML files (files/) without any library, keeping their layout ideas (scorecard with deltas and a commentary column, filter bar with counter and empty state, stepped form with a review step, lanes where the column is the state); the "start from a template, reread, replace hardcoded values, build before delivering" rule rewritten for a Sklubot bot; translated into French.
Only text is included; no picture or other file of the original folders is bundled. Names of other products are not used as titles.
